<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- §12: Hindi. Keys mirror values/strings.xml exactly.
     Tone (§10.6): plain, warm, zero jargon — the same voice as the English,
     not a literal translation of it. Words people actually use are kept in
     Devanagari rather than replaced with Sanskritised coinages: ओटीपी, यूपीआई,
     पिन, बैंक, ऐप. "तिजोरी" for vault because a locker is the thing an Indian
     reader already pictures. -->
